This is also the design most suited to DIY, since the technique behind classic **leopard print nails** is really just repeated dotting-tool work rather than freehand painting. If you want the full walkthrough, <a href='/blog/print-nails/how-to-do-leopard-print-nails'>how to do leopard print nails at home</a> covers the tool, the layering order, and the coat count that keeps the finish from looking muddy.

