## Bold and Colorful Leopard Print Twists

Picture stepping out for a night that calls for more than nude and caramel, hot pink or electric blue under the spots instead of the expected neutral.

**Leopard print nails** don't require a natural-looking base to work. Swap the usual beige or tan for hot pink, cobalt, or even a deep emerald, keep the rosette structure the same, and the print reads as a fashion statement rather than a nod to camouflage. Chrome powder layered over a bold base pushes it further still, catching light in a way that a matte neutral leopard never will.

