## Leopard Print Nails for Work vs Going Out

Leopard print can look entirely professional for the office when the coverage is scaled back and the finish stays matte or neutral. Going-out styling is where full coverage, gloss, and bold color get to take over.

For work, the safest formula for **leopard print nails** is restraint on two fronts at once: coverage and color. A single accent nail or a leopard French tip in a caramel or ash beige base, finished matte, reads polished rather than costume-like in a professional setting. The print stays recognisable without dominating the hand, which matters more in a meeting than it does anywhere else.

